ult but in the end  happy to see cozy living it up on the  big screen at the end of the day it's  pretty obvious that cosy and Heidi were  the perfect choices for Disney's Freaky  Friday do you think Disney made the  right choice or would you have rather  seen Emma huntin playing the role of  Ellie Blake in the on screen rendition  let us know what you think in the  comments and there you have it those are  the 10 things about the Freaky Friday  movie Disney doesn't want you to know if  you liked this video don't forget to  subscribe and give us a big thumbs up  thanks for watching  [Music]

